  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed financing consists of a US$4MM senior loan to Fernandes Guyana Enterprise (&#x201C;Fernandes Guyana&#x201D; or the &#x201C;Company&#x201D;) for an 8-year tenor, including a grace period of up to 18 months (the &#x201C;Loan&#x201D;). The Company will use the funds of the Loan to increase its current production and selling capacity to sell in the domestic market (the &quot;Project&quot;). Fernandes Guyana is part of Fernandes Concern Beheer N.V. (&quot;Fernandes Group&quot; or the &quot;Guarantor&quot;), one of Suriname&apos;s largest economic groups and a market leader in Suriname in most of the industries it operates including bakery.</narrative>
  </description>
